SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Salta art / AIR-M Ebenböckhaus Residency 2027 
 for South American Artists (Munich)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 15 Nov 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nAIR-M Ebenböckhaus and the
  non-profit Salta art\, in partnership with ERA Foundation\, offer a resid
 ency for two contemporary visual artists from South America at the Ebenbö
 ckhaus in Munich-Pasing\, Germany\, from 7 July to 29 September 2027.\n\nO
 rganisation: Salta art with AIR-M Ebenböckhaus (City of Munich) and ERA F
 oundation\nLocation: Ebenböckhaus\, Munich-Pasing\, Germany. Open only to
  visual artists born and based or residing in South America.\nAward: Grant
  and accommodation contract of EUR 1\,300 per month per artist from the Ci
 ty of Munich (accommodation is rent-free)\, plus return travel from South 
 America (economy / 2nd class)\, a shared studio at Empfangshalle in Munich
 's Museumsquartier\, a EUR 600 research trip allowance and a MakerPlus mem
 bership at MakerSpace Munich. No application fee.\nDuration: 7 July to 29 
 September 2027 (about 12 weeks\, 2 positions).\n\nMore: https://saltaart.o
 rg/application?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://saltaart.org/application?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&
 utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Ebenböckhaus\, Munich-Pasing\, Germany. Open only to visual artis
 ts born and based or residing in South America.
END:VEVENT
